{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vcqCCHtaw41794529596.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>同源康醫藥配股集資近2.9億元。</p><p></p><p>公司向同業齊魯及CVG Global分別配售5,700萬股H股，及1,900萬股H股，配售總股數7,600萬股H股，佔已擴大發行股本逾一成六。每股配售價3.8元，較上日收市價折讓逾百分之7。集資所得主要用於新藥臨床試驗。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:33:25.810435+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:00.035132+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:26:45.675317+00:00","content_hash":"609a4524c743217678344a57358cdd4da7ecbd41fcf3b082f9cdc51a0a2a99b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:33:25.810435+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}